#section[About This Course]

This #duration AI course is designed specifically for academic researchers, scientists, and graduate students. Each session is practical, hands-on, and focused on real-world research applications, drawing inspiration from industry standards and robust academic workflows.

No prior technical background is required. Researchers will learn how to use modern AI tools to accelerate literature reviews, design methodologies, manipulate data across platforms, streamline academic writing, and enhance the overall publication process while maintaining strict academic integrity.

